{"4207800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hunter's Journey: Nightmare Hunting Collector's Edition", "steam_appid": 4207800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4210780], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207800/extras/0886c7bc4250cf9f3d432aec65b4a18d.avif?t=1783693395\" width=1200 height=460 /></span><br>The forest is changing — and it wants you to notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creeping Rot spreads through the trees, warping roots, twisting animals into monstrous forms, and stirring something ancient beneath the soil. As Velimir, a young hunter sent by the Academy, you follow strange signs and relics into a woodland where nothing obeys the rules of nature anymore. Shadows shift, illusions whisper, and the Blight — a forgotten spirit — rises again after centuries of silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the home of a hermit witch, walk through shrines carved from bone, descend into fungal caverns glowing with poisonous light, and uncover ritual sites abandoned long ago. Each area reflects the forest’s fractured memory, revealing pieces of a truth it has tried to bury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore protective symbols. Decipher lore etched into bark and roots. Confront ancient magic that thinks, remembers… and resists. Step by step, the forest will show you what woke the Blight — and what still lies waiting beneath it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Explore eerie, richly detailed locations shaped by forgotten rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Solve Hidden Object scenes intertwined with illusions, old magic, and the living forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Use enchanted artifacts and puzzle mechanisms created by the woodland’s ancient protectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Collect lore fragments to uncover the origins of the Blight and the spreading Rot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Unlock the Bonus Chapter and discover the final truth behind the awakening power beneath the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4207800/extras/0886c7bc4250cf9f3d432aec65b4a18d.avif?t=1783693395\" width=1200 height=460 /></span><br>The forest is changing — and it wants you to notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creeping Rot spreads through the trees, warping roots, twisting animals into monstrous forms, and stirring something ancient beneath the soil. As Velimir, a young hunter sent by the Academy, you follow strange signs and relics into a woodland where nothing obeys the rules of nature anymore. Shadows shift, illusions whisper, and the Blight — a forgotten spirit — rises again after centuries of silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the home of a hermit witch, walk through shrines carved from bone, descend into fungal caverns glowing with poisonous light, and uncover ritual sites abandoned long ago. Each area reflects the forest’s fractured memory, revealing pieces of a truth it has tried to bury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore protective symbols. Decipher lore etched into bark and roots. Confront ancient magic that thinks, remembers… and resists. Step by step, the forest will show you what woke the Blight — and what still lies waiting beneath it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Explore eerie, richly detailed locations shaped by forgotten rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Solve Hidden Object scenes intert